presets.netlist:
Voltage divider
V1 in 0 {Vin}
R1 in out {R1}
R2 out 0 {R2}
.op

Two-source network
V1 p 0 {V1}
R1 p a {R1}
R2 a b {R2}
R3 a 0 {R3}
R4 b 0 {R4}
R5 b q {R5}
V2 q 0 {V2}
.op

Wheatstone bridge with a meter
V1 t 0 {V}
R1 t c {R1}
R2 c 0 {R2}
R3 t d {R3}
R4 d 0 {R4}
RM c d {Rm}
.op

Voltage amplifier model
VS sig 0 {Vs}
RS sig in {Rs}
RIN in 0 {Rin}
E1 x 0 in 0 {Avo}
ROUT x out {Rout}
RL out 0 {RL}
.op

RC low-pass
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 1 0 1n 1n 1 2) AC 1
R1 in out {R}
C1 out 0 {C}
.tran {tstep} {tstop}
.ac dec 20 {fmin} {fmax}

Half-wave rectifier
V1 in 0 SIN(0 {Vp} {f})
D1 in out DSIL
C1 out 0 {C}
RL out 0 {RL}
.model DSIL D(IS=2.5n N=1.75)
.tran {tstep} {tstop}

Common-emitter amplifier
VCC vcc 0 {Vcc}
VS sig 0 SIN(0 {Vs} {f}) AC 1
CIN sig b 10u
R1 vcc b {R1}
R2 b 0 {R2}
RC vcc c {Rc}
RE e 0 {Re}
CE e 0 100u
COUT c out 10u
RL out 0 100k
Q1 c b e QN
.model QN NPN(BF=150)
.tran {tstep} {tstop}
.ac dec 20 10 1meg

Inverting amplifier
V1 in 0 SIN(0 {Vin} {f}) AC 1
R1 in inv {Rin}
R2 inv out {Rf}
X1 0 inv out OA
.model OA OPAMP(A=1e5 GBW={GBW} SR={SR} VPOS=15 VNEG=-15 VHEAD=1.5)
.tran {tstep} {tstop}
.ac dec 20 10 10meg

MOSFET flyback
VDD vdd 0 {Vdd}
VG g 0 PULSE(0 10 0 100n 100n {ton} {period})
L1 vdd a {L}
RL a d {RL}
D1 d k DF
RS vdd k {Rs}
COSS d 0 220p
M1 d g 0 NM
DB 0 d DBODY
.model NM NMOS(VTO=2 KP=5)
.model DF D(IS=1n N=1.5)
.model DBODY D(IS=1e-12 N=1)
.tran {tstep} {tstop}

Zener regulator
VIN in 0 0
RS in out {Rs}
DZ 0 out DZ
RL out 0 {RL}
.model DZ D(IS=1e-14 BV={Vz} IBV=5m)
.dc VIN 0 {Vmax} {Vstep}

Schmitt trigger
VS s 0 SIN(0 {A} {f})
VN in s SIN(0 {An} {fn})
X1 in 0 cmp OA
R1 in p {R1}
R2 p sch {R2}
X2 p 0 sch OA
.model OA OPAMP(A=1e5 GBW=10meg SR=1meg VPOS=5 VNEG=-5)
.tran {tstep} {tstop}

H-bridge
VDD vdd 0 {Vdd}
MP1 a gl vdd PM
MN1 a gl 0 NM
MP2 b gr vdd PM
MN2 b gr 0 NM
LM a m {Lm}
RM m b {Rm}
VGL gl 0 PULSE({Vdd} 0 0 1u 1u {thalf} {period})
VGR gr 0 PULSE(0 {Vdd} 0 1u 1u {thalf} {period})
.model NM NMOS(VTO=2 KP=5)
.model PM PMOS(VTO=-2 KP=5)
.tran {tstep} {tstop}

Buck converter
VIN in 0 {Vin}
MP sw g in PM
VG g 0 PULSE({Vin} 0 0 10n 10n {ton} {period})
D1 0 sw DS
L1 sw out {L}
C1 out 0 {C}
RL out 0 {RL}
.model PM PMOS(VTO=-2 KP=10)
.model DS D(IS=1e-9 N=1)
.tran {tstep} {tstop}

Active low-pass
V1 in 0 SIN(0 {Vin} {f}) AC 1
R1 in inv {Rin}
R2 inv out {Rf}
C1 inv out {C}
X1 0 inv out OA
.model OA OPAMP(A=1e5 GBW=1meg VPOS=15 VNEG=-15)
.tran {tstep} {tstop}
.ac dec 20 10 1meg

RL step
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 {V} 0 1n 1n 1 2)
R1 in a {R}
L1 a 0 {L}
.tran {tstep} {t}

RC square wave
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 {V} 0 1n 1n {th} {T})
R1 in out {R}
C1 out 0 {C}
.tran {tstep} {tstop}

Series RLC step
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 {V} 0 1n 1n 1 2)
R1 in a {R}
L1 a out {L}
C1 out 0 {C}
.tran {tstep} {t}
